install-note.text:
The Svelte adapter ships as a subpath entry point and pulls in an optional peer dependency, so install it only if you use it.

[table] Import / What you get / Peer dependency
@mzebley/canvas-watch — Framework-agnostic core (createCanvasWatcher) — none
@mzebley/canvas-watch/svelte — Svelte adapter (watchBgCanvas action and reactive canvasWatch state) — svelte >= 5.7

